Source: nvme-tcp-dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Byeonghoon Yoo <bhyoo@bhyoo.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: nvme-tcp-host-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 3.0.10), ca-certificates, curl, gnupg, xz-utils
Conflicts: nvme-extras-dkms
Replaces: nvme-extras-dkms
Description: supplemental NVMe/TCP host modules managed by DKMS
 Builds nvme-fabrics and nvme-tcp only when the vendor kernel does not
 already provide them. The vendor kernel must provide nvme_core.

Package: nvmet-tcp-target-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 3.0.10), ca-certificates, curl, gnupg, xz-utils
Conflicts: nvme-extras-dkms
Replaces: nvme-extras-dkms
Description: supplemental NVMe/TCP target transport managed by DKMS
 Builds nvmet-tcp only when the vendor kernel does not already provide it.
 The vendor kernel must provide the nvmet target core.
